waveqlab3d input file: Phase 6 traditional elastic all-face PML
&problem_list
 name='data/test_elastic_traditional_o6_pml', problem='default', response='elastic',
 nblocks=1, t_final=0.02d0, CFL=0.20d0, coupling='locked',
 fd_type='traditional', order=6, mesh_source='compute', type_of_mesh='cartesian',
 material_source='hardcode', interpol=F, w_stride=1, w_fault=F,
 use_topography=F, topo=1d0, mollify_source=F /
&block_list
